  "guid": "com.chouun.iof",
  "name": "Inventory Organizing Features (Ported to 4.0.x)",
  "slug": "inventory-organizing-features-ported-to-40x",
  "teaser": "Adds several inventory organizing features which rely on item tags, such as sort locking, move locking and container organizing. Also adds a button to take out all the items from a container.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/HPa8J3CgLaSV07vWAXgnrlYUdESjt8JCs1iNHfkr.png",
  "downloads": 7055,
  "favourites_count": 22,
  "description": "<p><em>THIS IS A QUICK FIX FOR THE MOD.</em></p>\n<p><em>IF NIGHTINGALE OR ANY CONTRIBUTOR WANTS; I WILL TAKE IT DOWN NO QUESTIONS ASKED.</em></p>\n<h2>Frequent Usages:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><code>@o</code> —— Organize. Makes a container pull items which can fit into it. Items which are being pulled are determined by container’s filters and parameters which user has specified.</li>\n<li><code>@o &lt;category&gt;;</code> —— Collects the specific category only. Like “@o money;” (without quotes). NOTICE the SEMICOLON is important, and the bracket isn’t needed.</li>\n<li><code>@o !&lt;category&gt;;</code> —— Collects everything except the specific category. Like “@o !ammo;” (without quotes), which collects everything except ammo.</li>\n<li><code>@o n:&lt;item name&gt;;</code> —— Collects items which name contains the given string. Like “@o n:5.45;” (without quotes), which collects all items with “5.45” in their name.</li>\n<li><code>@o &lt;condition 1&gt;|&lt;condition 2&gt;;</code> —— Collects items matching either condition 1 or condition 2. Like “@o n:7.62|n:5.45;” (without quotes), which collects all items with “7.62” or “5.45” in their name.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>See full documentation and explanation of all the features here: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2096/inventory-organizing-features-ported-to-311x\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">3.11.x</a> and <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/856/inventory-organizing-features\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">original</a></p>\n<p>Remember to go there and thank <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/23286-nightingale/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Nightingale</a>! They did all the hard work.</p>\n<h2>Credits:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/23286-nightingale/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Nightingale</a> upgraded the original mod to 3.7.</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/9836/deadleaves\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">DeadLeaves</a> upgraded the original mod to 3.8.3.</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/56861-yume/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Yume</a> added recursive container sort.</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/59522-meepowski/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Meepowski</a> upgraded the mod to support 3.9.0.</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/63839-kyomiko/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">KyoMiko</a> upgraded the mod to support 3.10.0.</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/79881-garlicbreadtcg/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">garlicbreadtcg</a> upgraded the mod to support 3.11.x.</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/86814/chouun\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">ChouUn</a> ported  the mod to support 4.0.x.</li>\n</ul>\n",
